1 § 2206. SPECIALIZED SHELTER SERVICES
2 Level 3: specialized services.
3 (1) To the extent funds are appropriated for this purpose:
4 (A) the relevant Agency of Human Services departments shall
5 determine the need for and, to the extent funds permit, develop specialized
6 shelter services that comply with the Department of Public Safety, Vermont
