16 (D) use only hotel and motel rates established by the General
17 Assembly;
18 (E) enter into agreements for the use of blocks of hotel and motel
19 rooms and negotiate conditions of use for those blocks, including access to
20 providers of case management and other supportive services, with space to
21 provide services as negotiated; and

